(7556882, 1210710, 97225, '<td valign="top">Great entry. Top shot. It reminds me of the ads for His Master''s Voice.</td>', 'Great entry. Top shot. It reminds me of the ads for His Master''s Voice.', '2018-01-31 23:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7556883, 1210769, 97225, '<td valign="top">Top 2. Really meets the challenge well.</td>', 'Top 2. Really meets the challenge well.', '2018-01-31 23:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7556884, 1210803, 97225, '<td valign="top">Good photo for this aided well by the processing. Top 3.</td>', 'Good photo for this aided well by the processing. Top 3.', '2018-01-31 23:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7556915, 1210788, 173844, '<td valign="top">Many components adding up to a compelling image.  The claustrophobia and restlessness of imprisonment are portrayed in gut-wrenching, visceral fashion.  The ghostly man has his face covered, which adds to the sense of uneasiness.  The window leaning against the wall is like a useless, unreal door.  The stark environment is perfect.  I''m unsure about the clock.  Without it, which imho would improve the photo, I would think that the noise was in his mind, but something is surely to be gained by amplifying the passage of time.  Perhaps if the clock were as translucent as the figures that sense of it being so flagrantly real could be mitigated.  Just a thought.   <br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Many components adding up to a compelling image.  The claustrophobia and restlessness of imprisonment are portrayed in gut-wrenching, visceral fashion.  The ghostly man has his face covered, which adds to the sense of uneasiness.  The window leaning against the wall is like a useless, unreal door.  The stark environment is perfect.  I''m unsure about the clock.  Without it, which imho would improve the photo, I would think that the noise was in his mind, but something is surely to be gained by amplifying the passage of time.  Perhaps if the clock were as translucent as the figures that sense of it being so flagrantly real could be mitigated.  Just a thought.   Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2018-02-01 10:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7556935, 1210780, 173844, '<td valign="top">This could have been boring but it''s far from it.  The drummer is taut and involved, glistening with perspiration.  The green highlights are great counterpoints to the darkness of the stage.  It''s as if music is emanating from the image itself.  And I admire his fortitude, keeping the beat while being attacked by a cymbal.</td>', 'This could have been boring but it''s far from it.  The drummer is taut and involved, glistening with perspiration.  The green highlights are great counterpoints to the darkness of the stage.  It''s as if music is emanating from the image itself.  And I admire his fortitude, keeping the beat while being attacked by a cymbal.', '2018-02-01 12:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7556936, 1210721, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and unusual image.  Striking (no pun intended) in many ways, including the pleasing disposition of the bells, the perspective and the weird sense of depth.  I love the washed out feel.  And yet these bells must be capable of a resounding clangor.  It''s also kind of like you''re looking up into a rocket --  that''d be loud.<br/>Personal second favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Very interesting and unusual image.  Striking (no pun intended) in many ways, including the pleasing disposition of the bells, the perspective and the weird sense of depth.  I love the washed out feel.  And yet these bells must be capable of a resounding clangor.  It''s also kind of like you''re looking up into a rocket --  that''d be loud.Personal second favorite of the challenge.', '2018-02-01 12:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7556937, 1210799, 173844, '<td valign="top">This quivvery image sounds like an insistent buzzing to me.  Looks like a stretch of water, surrounded by vegetation, leading to and passing under a bridge.  The white bits look like falling shards of glass.  Excellent portrayal of noise without really getting to it.</td>', 'This quivvery image sounds like an insistent buzzing to me.  Looks like a stretch of water, surrounded by vegetation, leading to and passing under a bridge.  The white bits look like falling shards of glass.  Excellent portrayal of noise without really getting to it.', '2018-02-01 12:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7556938, 1210769, 173844, '<td valign="top">Full blast!  She''s both making an uproar and being subject to one, backed by a cloud of noise.  Nicely devised and executed.  Fine image.</td>', 'Full blast!  She''s both making an uproar and being subject to one, backed by a cloud of noise.  Nicely devised and executed.  Fine image.', '2018-02-01 12:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7556939, 1210777, 173844, '<td valign="top">Quiet small talk or are they competing with the clamor of the bar environment?  The sun blasting in through the window is intense, and can be experienced as loud.  What finally cinches it is the attendant heptagonal bokeh (is that what I should be calling it?), further adding to the tumult.  I love how you''ve come at the challenge sideways yet managed to get your point across.</td>', 'Quiet small talk or are they competing with the clamor of the bar environment?  The sun blasting in through the window is intense, and can be experienced as loud.  What finally cinches it is the attendant heptagonal bokeh (is that what I should be calling it?), further adding to the tumult.  I love how you''ve come at the challenge sideways yet managed to get your point across.', '2018-02-01 13:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7556940, 1210706, 173844, '<td valign="top">I love this image, but for the luminance noise and the title it seems very quiet.  Perhaps the noise is in his head.</td>', 'I love this image, but for the luminance noise and the title it seems very quiet.  Perhaps the noise is in his head.', '2018-02-01 13:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7556941, 1210803, 173844, '<td valign="top">Cool way to present this image.  It works really well.  He looks to be quite calm within the din.  I also like how your choice of lens brings his right pedal foot down to the front edge.</td>', 'Cool way to present this image.  It works really well.  He looks to be quite calm within the din.  I also like how your choice of lens brings his right pedal foot down to the front edge.', '2018-02-01 13:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7556942, 1210787, 173844, '<td valign="top">I think I can imagine how that''s so, or at least I can try.  Is it a kind of synesthesia?  In addition to being loud by color, the flaring of the lines is like a picture of sound emanating from a trumpet, for example.  Very interesting take on the challenge.</td>', 'I think I can imagine how that''s so, or at least I can try.  Is it a kind of synesthesia?  In addition to being loud by color, the flaring of the lines is like a picture of sound emanating from a trumpet, for example.  Very interesting take on the challenge.', '2018-02-01 13:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7556943, 1210616, 173844, '<td valign="top">Loudest image of the challenge.  I want to plug my ears just looking at it.  Additionally, it''s a fine image.  All the activity and business in the background supplement the sound of the jackhammer.  The composition is complex, but the pieces do come together.  Black and white is effective.</td>', 'Loudest image of the challenge.  I want to plug my ears just looking at it.  Additionally, it''s a fine image.  All the activity and business in the background supplement the sound of the jackhammer.  The composition is complex, but the pieces do come together.  Black and white is effective.', '2018-02-01 13:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7556969, 1210787, 9668, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot! Noisy in color and in contrasts!</td>', 'Awesome shot! Noisy in color and in contrasts!', '2018-02-01 15:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7556970, 1210716, 19825, '<td valign="top">You have to love a good train shot (or at least I do).</td>', 'You have to love a good train shot (or at least I do).', '2018-02-01 15:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7556971, 1210616, 19825, '<td valign="top">These things are painfully noisy.</td>', 'These things are painfully noisy.', '2018-02-01 15:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7556985, 1210710, 173844, '<td valign="top">"His master''s voice" on steroids.  And so loud.  Nicely executed.  One point --  the props don''t have the feeling of a real setting; a couch, a side table for the lamp and an area rug, e.g., might flesh it out.  I like the composition and the sense of movement.  And your dog looks like he or she is giving as good as getting.</td>', '"His master''s voice" on steroids.  And so loud.  Nicely executed.  One point --  the props don''t have the feeling of a real setting; a couch, a side table for the lamp and an area rug, e.g., might flesh it out.  I like the composition and the sense of movement.  And your dog looks like he or she is giving as good as getting.', '2018-02-01 16:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7556986, 1210716, 173844, '<td valign="top">Yeah, it''s pretty loud, though you do become acclimated to it to the extent that it''s merely background white noise.  Tourists, however, do get the full effect.  So what I like here is the notion that there''s a nonchalant calm amid the storm.  I also like how there''s a feel for the stations flying by, at least form a passenger''s perspective.</td>', 'Yeah, it''s pretty loud, though you do become acclimated to it to the extent that it''s merely background white noise.  Tourists, however, do get the full effect.  So what I like here is the notion that there''s a nonchalant calm amid the storm.  I also like how there''s a feel for the stations flying by, at least form a passenger''s perspective.', '2018-02-01 16:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7556987, 1210738, 173844, '<td valign="top">Along with the sense of vibrant color being noisy, I get the feeling that this is in a disco or arcade or something like that, and so very loud in and of itself.  I also like that there seems to be a malevolent figure, especially the face, coming out of the scene and directly towards the viewer, which might elicit a very loud scream.</td>', 'Along with the sense of vibrant color being noisy, I get the feeling that this is in a disco or arcade or something like that, and so very loud in and of itself.  I also like that there seems to be a malevolent figure, especially the face, coming out of the scene and directly towards the viewer, which might elicit a very loud scream.', '2018-02-01 16:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7556988, 1210591, 173844, '<td valign="top">His expression conveys his force, and we can hear that trombone rip off its powerful notes.  The moment is well-captured.  Now if only he was also wearing a loud shirt.</td>', 'His expression conveys his force, and we can hear that trombone rip off its powerful notes.  The moment is well-captured.  Now if only he was also wearing a loud shirt.', '2018-02-01 17:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7556991, 1210800, 173844, '<td valign="top">We can well imagine.  Right now it looks like Pavarotti is holding back, but I have no doubts.  My friend has a miniature schnauzer whose high pitched bark is like a dental drill.  He say that when he (Gustav) barks in the car its like gunfire.  Cute pooch, affectionately portrayed.</td>', 'We can well imagine.  Right now it looks like Pavarotti is holding back, but I have no doubts.  My friend has a miniature schnauzer whose high pitched bark is like a dental drill.  He say that when he (Gustav) barks in the car its like gunfire.  Cute pooch, affectionately portrayed.', '2018-02-01 17:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7556992, 1210804, 173844, '<td valign="top">Not simply loud, but also purposeful.  A slice of history, errr, herstory.</td>', 'Not simply loud, but also purposeful.  A slice of history, errr, herstory.', '2018-02-01 17:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7556993, 1210646, 173844, '<td valign="top">A street corner musician, is that all you got?  Then the motorcycles is the background catch my eye and, oh, that''s a lot better.  A fine cacophony.</td>', 'A street corner musician, is that all you got?  Then the motorcycles is the background catch my eye and, oh, that''s a lot better.  A fine cacophony.', '2018-02-01 17:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7556994, 1210668, 173844, '<td valign="top">The drum set his father''s best friend gave him on his sixth birthday, and still going strong.  Nicely caught sounding the cymbal.  I like his concentration.</td>', 'The drum set his father''s best friend gave him on his sixth birthday, and still going strong.  Nicely caught sounding the cymbal.  I like his concentration.', '2018-02-01 17:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7556995, 1210786, 173844, '<td valign="top">Great science fair demonstration, until the principal pulls the plug.  Convincingly portrays sound translated into kinetic energy.</td>', 'Great science fair demonstration, until the principal pulls the plug.  Convincingly portrays sound translated into kinetic energy.', '2018-02-01 17:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7556996, 1210805, 173844, '<td valign="top">You can feel this boom in the pit of your stomach.  The streak of fire is beautifully caught.  It does look like the crane might topple.</td>', 'You can feel this boom in the pit of your stomach.  The streak of fire is beautifully caught.  It does look like the crane might topple.', '2018-02-01 17:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7556997, 1210688, 173844, '<td valign="top">Just to look at this makes me salivate so, a la Pavlov, you''ve given us ample provocation to also hear the sound unsounded.  Nice, simple image that packs a punch.</td>', 'Just to look at this makes me salivate so, a la Pavlov, you''ve given us ample provocation to also hear the sound unsounded.  Nice, simple image that packs a punch.', '2018-02-01 17:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7556998, 1210745, 173844, '<td valign="top">Everybody seems to be enjoying the racket, the whup-whup-whup bouncing around in the stomach.  Here the accompanying sound underscores the action, a sound track, as it were.  Good story-telling, as we wonder about what''s going on.</td>', 'Everybody seems to be enjoying the racket, the whup-whup-whup bouncing around in the stomach.  Here the accompanying sound underscores the action, a sound track, as it were.  Good story-telling, as we wonder about what''s going on.', '2018-02-01 17:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557003, 1210738, 100831, '<td valign="top">GOT IT. The colors are electric.</td>', 'GOT IT. The colors are electric.', '2018-02-01 20:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7557004, 1210710, 100831, '<td valign="top">Great setup. Good thinking.</td>', 'Great setup. Good thinking.', '2018-02-01 20:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
