(7557652, 1210788, 141319, '<td valign="top">Oh wow, this is an amazing image.<br/> <br/>I am sure it doesn''t amuse you much, just have to mention that I slept through a major party across the road from me the other night where things got out of hand and people started shooting ... never heard a thing :-). It must be awful sleeping so lightly that a ticking clock wakes you :-(. <br/></td>', 'Oh wow, this is an amazing image. I am sure it doesn''t amuse you much, just have to mention that I slept through a major party across the road from me the other night where things got out of hand and people started shooting ... never heard a thing :-). It must be awful sleeping so lightly that a ticking clock wakes you :-(. ', '2018-02-06 10:49:08.000000', NULL, 0);
